<p>Very cool, great assets. That said, I'm not quite sure I get it. Here's what I <em>think</em> is going on, please correct me if I've missed something:</p>
<p>We see the revisions in reverse chronological order - most recent first, then going back one at a time. The earliest revision suggests the Site-5 stuff was just a glitch, but then it turns out it actually was pointing to a real island. And then we see that with each subsequent revision, the mandated exclusion zone is getting bigger, and more and more steps are being taken to prevent personnel from entering. And I guess knowledge of it (maybe laying eyes on it?) makes you think it's real and want to go? And then you get there and your brain melts. So now the most recent ones scrub all information about it and just say there is no real place, and that the information about it just keeps cropping up (possibly actually being edited to be included by someone in the Foundation under its effect?).</p>
<p>Either way, the art assets and weirdness are enough for an easy +1, I'm just trying to figure out if I'm following correctly or not.</p>

